        "fileName": "rules.md",
        "mimeType": "text/plain",
        "sizeBytes": 1489,
        "assetPath": "source-docs/doc-1-muydc17h-v1/rules.md",
        "parseRevision": 1,
        "parseStatus": "parsed",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-001",
            "text": "# 学生奖助学金申报与评审 测试材料规则来源",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 0
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-002",
            "text": "**范围声明：**本文件用于隔离的合成流程测试，不是正式校规、申报通知、财务审批或法律意见。所有测试身份、编号和金额均虚构。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 1
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-003",
            "text": "## 公开来源与适用边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 2
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-004",
            "text": "### 教育部、财政部《本专科生国家奖学金评审办法》",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 3
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-005",
            "text": "- 来源：https://www.moe.gov.cn/srcsite/A05/s7505/201909/t20190930_401817.html",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 4
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-006",
            "text": "- 适用范围：只适用于本专科生国家奖学金。明确材料完整性、程序规范性、条件相符性；成绩和综合考评均前10%，或均进入前30%并提供经学校审核盖章的突出表现证明。各校仍须有当年实施方案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 5
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-007",
            "text": "### 成都理工大学2025年本专科学生资助政策简介",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 6
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-008",
            "text": "- 来源：https://xsc.cdut.edu.cn/info/1032/3429.htm",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 7
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-009",
            "text": "- 适用范围：学校2025年资助政策介绍，不替代当前年度/项目的评审通知与细则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 8
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-010",
            "text": "## 本次审核的规则边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 9
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-011",
            "text": "国家奖学金门槛按上述教育部办法列示。一般奖助项目须另附对应项目本年度正式通知；本案综合考评排名 18/120，不能在缺少校内盖章突出表现材料时自动通过例外条件。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 10
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-012",
            "text": "## 测试要求",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 11
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-013",
            "text": "- 只把来源文件中明确写出的内容当作外部规则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 12
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-014",
            "text": "- 缺少校内当年通知、审批、积分映射、授权签字或有效性确认时，标记待确认，不要猜测。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 13
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-015",
            "text": "- 证据需要引用案卷中的具体材料与可定位位置。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 14
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydc17h-v1-block-016",
            "text": "- 本文件并非本次模拟数据的答案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 15
            },
            "kind": "text"
          }
        ],
        "usage": "registered",
        "byteHash": "3872fbb90b79f3ea83f1839ba2d5103f2e161fa61043ece9ef62efdc0fe84051",
        "active": true
      },
